---
---

<section class="checkout">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="checkout-copy reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow">Checkout</div>
      <h2>Fast the first time. Instant after that.</h2>
      <p>
        We want to remember you when you checkout. Save your profile now —
        save the hustle later.
      </p>
      <ul class="checkout-list">
        <li>Shipping to our offices is charged by weight, together with your products</li>
        <li>You'll be contacted shortly after ordering with your shipment dates</li>
        <li>Pay securely on this page; shipping is already in your total</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="mock-form reveal d1">
      <h4>Your Details</h4>
      <p class="form-sub">
        One-time setup. We'll use this to speed up every order after.
      </p>
      <div class="field">
        <label>Full Name</label>
        <input type="text" placeholder="e.g. Wanjiru Kamau" />
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label>Phone / WhatsApp</label>
        <input type="text" placeholder="07xx xxx xxx" />
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label>Delivery Area</label>
        <input type="text" placeholder="e.g. Nairobi CBD" />
      </div>
      <label class="save-note"
        ><input type="checkbox" checked style="margin:0;" /> Remember me for
        faster checkout next time</label
      >
      <a
        href="/shop"
        class="btn-primary"
        style="display:block;text-align:center;background:var(--black);color:var(--warm-white);border-color:var(--black);"
        >Continue to Shopping</a
      >
      <p class="shipping-note">
        Shipping (by weight, to our offices) is included in your total. You'll
        be contacted shortly with your shipment dates.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
